      "sourceHeading": "MINIMUM REQUIREMENTS- CONVENTIONAL RADIOLOGY",
      "requirement": "Fluorescent lights will provide higher illumination level up to 540 Candela during patient transfer on and from the table, equipment setting, room cleaning, and equipment maintenance.",
